<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Mening saytim</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --surface: #f4f6fb;
    --text: #1b1f2a;
    --muted: #5b6475;
    --accent: #2f6bff;
    --accent-text: #ffffff;
    --border: #e1e5ee;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #12151c;
      --surface: #1b202b;
      --text: #eef1f7;
      --muted: #a0a9bb;
      --accent: #5b8cff;
      --accent-text: #0b0e14;
      --border: #2a3140;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  header {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; height: 64px; }
  .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--accent); }
  nav ul { display: flex; gap: 20px; list-style: none; }
  nav a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-size: .95rem; }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .hero { padding: 90px 0 70px; text-align: center; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .hero p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 28px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block; padding: 12px 26px; border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-text);
    text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .btn:hover { opacity: .9; }
  section { padding: 60px 0; }
  section h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px;
  }
  .card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; }
  .about { background: var(--surface); }
  .about p { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
  form { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  input, textarea {
    width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
    font: inherit;
  }
  textarea { min-height: 110px; resize: vertical; }
  #msg { text-align: center; color: var(--accent); min-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 10px; }
  footer { text-align: center; padding: 28px 0; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: .9rem; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { nav ul { gap: 12px; } nav a { font-size: .85rem; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">MeningSayt</div>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#xizmatlar">Xizmatlar</a></li>
        <li><a href="#haqimizda">Biz haqimizda</a></li>
        <li><a href="#aloqa">Aloqa</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Salom! Xush kelibsiz</h1>
      <p>Bu yerga o'zingiz yoki biznesingiz haqida qisqa va jozibali matn yozing.</p>
      <a href="#aloqa" class="btn">Bog'lanish</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="xizmatlar">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Xizmatlar</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>Birinchi xizmat</h3><p>Xizmat haqida qisqacha ma'lumot shu yerga yoziladi.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Ikkinchi xizmat</h3><p>Xizmat haqida qisqacha ma'lumot shu yerga yoziladi.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Uchinchi xizmat</h3><p>Xizmat haqida qisqacha ma'lumot shu yerga yoziladi.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="haqimizda" class="about">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Biz haqimizda</h2>
      <p>Bu yerda o'zingiz, jamoangiz yoki kompaniyangiz haqida ma'lumot yozing: qachon boshlangan, nima bilan shug'ullanadi va nimasi bilan ajralib turadi.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="aloqa">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Aloqa</h2>
      <form id="form">
        <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Ismingiz" required>
        <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Email" required>
        <textarea id="text" placeholder="Xabaringiz" required></textarea>
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Yuborish</button>
      </form>
      <p id="msg"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="container">&copy; 2026 MeningSayt. Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.</div>
</footer>

<script>
  document.getElementById('form').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    var name = document.getElementById('name').value;
    document.getElementById('msg').textContent = 'Rahmat, ' + name + '! Xabaringiz qabul qilindi.';
    this.reset();
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
